---
title: SEQ-02 — Recite Surah (UC-07–UC-11, UC-28)
config:
  theme: neutral
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Reader as Quran Reader
    participant App as Itqan App
    participant Account as Account Service
    participant RS as Recitation Service
    participant AI as Analysis Service
    participant CE as Comparison Engine
    participant DB as Database
    participant Progress as Progress Service
    Reader->>App: Browse 37 Juz Amma Surahs and Uthmani verses
    Note over App: Bundled text works offline, no session required to read
    Reader->>App: Select Surah, then Mujawwid or Mushajji mode
    App->>Account: Check active recitation consent
    Account->>DB: Read Account and active ConsentRecord
    DB-->>Account: Role and consent status
    Account-->>App: Consent active or needed
    alt Consent missing
        App-->>Reader: Ask for recitation consent
        alt Reader declines
            App-->>Reader: No session starts
        else Reader grants
            App->>Account: grantOrWithdrawConsent(grant, recitation)
            Account->>DB: Insert dated grant
            DB-->>Account: Grant active
            Account-->>App: Consent recorded
        end
    end
    opt Consent active or newly granted
        App->>App: Check microphone permission
        alt Permission denied
            App-->>Reader: Explain how to grant it, no session starts
        else Permission granted
            App->>RS: startSession(Reader, Surah, mode)
            RS->>Account: Recheck Reader role and active consent
            Account->>DB: Read role and active recitation grant
            DB-->>Account: Reader and active grant
            Account-->>RS: Allowed
            RS-->>App: Session Started, Surah and mode fixed
            App-->>Reader: Show first verse, begin capture (Active)
            Note over App,RS: Capture 16 kHz mono verse segments in memory only
            loop Each reached verse until ending
                Reader->>App: Recite verse
                App->>App: Detect verse end automatically
                App->>RS: analyseVerse(verse ID, verse audio in memory)
                RS->>AI: Analyse one verse of audio in memory
                Note over AI: Stateless obadx/muaalem-model-v3_2 service
                alt Verse analysis unreliable
                    AI-->>RS: Could not analyse
                    RS-->>App: Could not analyse, count no words or mistakes
                    App-->>Reader: Show failure, continue to next verse
                else Verse analysed
                    AI-->>RS: Phonemes in memory
                    RS->>CE: compareVerse(phonemes, selected Surah and verse)
                    CE->>DB: Read expected Verse, Word and Tajweed references
                    DB-->>CE: Read-only text, positions and rule names
                    CE-->>RS: Located word and Tajweed mistakes
                    Note over CE: Wrong, skipped or added Word, mispronounced letter, Ghunnah, Qalqalah or Madd
                    Note over CE: Added Word links to the following expected Word
                    Note over RS: Tajweed-only penalty is 0.5, whole-word penalty is 1
                    Note over RS: Same mistakes and score in both modes
                    RS-->>App: Error types and Word locations for mode-specific feedback
                    alt Mujawwid mode
                        App-->>Reader: Highlight errors with direct feedback during the next verse
                    else Mushajji mode
                        App-->>Reader: Highlight errors with encouraging feedback and verse praise during the next verse
                    end
                end
                opt Reader taps highlighted or prompted Word
                    App-->>Reader: Play bundled reference Word audio only on request
                end
                opt App detects a pause or hesitation
                    App-->>Reader: Show next expected Word as a text hint
                    opt Reader taps hint
                        App-->>Reader: Play bundled reference Word audio
                    end
                end
            end
            alt Last verse analysed
                App->>RS: endAndScoreSession(completed)
            else Reader ends early
                Reader->>App: End session
                App->>RS: endAndScoreSession(ended early)
            else App closes/backgrounds, call, connection loss, or logout
                alt App can report interruption now
                    App->>RS: endAndScoreSession(interrupted)
                else Contact is unavailable
                    Note over App,RS: If needed, finalize on the next app open using analysed Words
                    Reader->>App: Open app again
                    App->>RS: endAndScoreSession(interrupted)
                end
            end
            RS->>RS: Count reached and reliably analysed Words
            alt Zero counted Words
                RS->>RS: Mastery Score is NULL, exclude from averages and mastery
            else One or more counted Words
                RS->>RS: Cap each Word at 1 effective error
                RS->>RS: Score = (counted Words - effective errors) / counted Words * 100, round to 1 decimal
            end
            RS->>DB: Atomically store ended Session summary and Mistakes
            Note over RS,DB: Never store or log audio, phonemes, feedback, prompts or assistance events
            DB-->>RS: Stored Session ID
            RS->>Progress: Recalculate progress and streak
            Progress->>DB: Read ended scored sessions
            DB-->>Progress: Session summaries
            Progress-->>RS: Derived values
            RS-->>App: Result or no-score summary
            App-->>Reader: Show results (UC-12 / SEQ-03)
            opt Mushajji mode
                App-->>Reader: Show end-of-session praise
            end
        end
    end
